Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.10,0:00:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人世謂緣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:04.70,0:00:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繫結的絲線糾結纏繞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:06.80,0:00:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脆弱可悲的彼岸花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:09.30,0:00:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在憤怒 悲傷 淚水中度日
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:13.90,0:00:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零點的帷幕彼方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:16.70,0:00:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難消之恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:23.30,0:00:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}いつか{\K80}光{\K40}に向{\K40}か{\K60}う　{\K60\K30}逆{\K90}さまの{\K60}蝶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:28.50,0:00:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}君{\K20}と{\K40}髪{\K50}を{\K30}切{\K60}る　{\K30\K80}鏡{\K40}の{\K100}中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:33.70,0:00:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}授業{\K50}中{\K60}の{\K80}廊下　{\K80\K40}響{\K40}く{\K100}足音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:39.40,0:00:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}絶{\K20}えず{\K30}雨{\K40}の{\K60}音{\K60}が　{\K20\K40}つい{\K50}て{\K40\K40}くる{\K50}よ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:44.80,0:00:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}感{\K30}じ{\K45}る{\K45}まま{\K30}の{\K70\K60}形{\K40}は{\K60}眩{\K60}しい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.00,0:00:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}甘{\K30}い{\K50}花{\K50}にな{\K80}る　{\K20\K30}毒{\K10}の{\K10}実{\K10}に{\K60}も{\K60}なる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:55.30,0:01:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}今日{\K60}も{\K120}雨　{\K40\K40}あの{\K120}日と今{\K40}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.50,0:01:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}空{\K30}と{\K30}空{\K30}で{\K30}つ{\K60}なぎ{\K80}た{\K30}い{\K60}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:04.80,0:01:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:07.80,0:01:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:10.60,0:01:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:15.70,0:01:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.20,0:01:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K160}ひとつの{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:21.10,0:01:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:26.70,0:01:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K20}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:29.10,0:01:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:31.90,0:01:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.40,0:01:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K10}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:39.90,0:01:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K140}それぞれの{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:42.70,0:01:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:03.70,0:02:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個好厲害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:05.20,0:02:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沉重的列車正緩緩浮向夜空
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:08.30,0:02:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs20}超能渡邊無論是名字還是相貌都在惡搞本動畫原案渡邊博
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:08.30,0:02:10.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正如超能渡邊預告的那樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:10.40,0:02:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他用雙手神力正吊起列車
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:12.60,0:02:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浮起來 浮起來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:14.60,0:02:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是鬧劇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:17.40,0:02:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是誰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:19.40,0:02:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼 這是最近的話題人物
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:22.20,0:02:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:25.20,0:02:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,視覺系靈能力者
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:27.10,0:02:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名叫基路 多 隆菲爾
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:29.40,0:02:30.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,中途殺入節目
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:31.50,0:02:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我來揭穿你的謊言了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:38.50,0:02:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基路大人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:40.00,0:02:42.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎 怎麼回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:42.60,0:02:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒人告訴我啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:45.48,0:02:46.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs20}請打敗他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:46.80,0:02:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這 這怎可能
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:48.70,0:02:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不愧是超能渡邊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:50.70,0:02:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果敢的接受了基路的挑戰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:12.30,0:03:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:15.10,0:03:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手 住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:18.20,0:03:20.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要想停下 就承認自己撒了謊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:21.50,0:03:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快停下啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:23.50,0:03:25.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不承認就會墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:25.90,0:03:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:39.10,0:03:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這麼做讓小姐知道了怎麼辦啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:42.10,0:03:43.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不讓她知道就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:43.80,0:03:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,話是沒錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:49.10,0:03:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是露餡了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:50.40,0:03:52.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要說我們之前勸你很多次哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:53.00,0:03:54.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了 知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:56.90,0:03:57.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是這裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:00.30,0:04:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:01.70,0:04:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走開
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,字:靈能力少年基路 多 隆菲爾向超能渡邊下挑戰書
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:03.10,0:04:05.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超能渡邊先生 怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:06.00,0:04:08.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他現在身處另一個世界
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:08.90,0:04:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個戲也做的太誇張了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:11.20,0:04:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不相信嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:12.60,0:04:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當然是了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:14.00,0:04:15.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 是嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:15.40,0:04:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還虧得你相信地獄少女的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:19.20,0:04:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是電視的聲音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:21.10,0:04:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過 僅僅把人送往地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:25.50,0:04:27.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想並不是解決問題的辦法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:28.40,0:04:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以這種事情不能再繼續下去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:33.20,0:04:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 突然
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:35.00,0:04:35.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不清楚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:35.80,0:04:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看來有什麼緣由
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:38.50,0:04:40.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饒了我 饒了我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:40.90,0:04:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是真正的超能力者
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:43.50,0:04:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都是騙術 饒了我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:45.60,0:04:48.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣 感覺到她的反應了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:50.10,0:04:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的能和她相通嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:52.40,0:04:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:54.30,0:04:57.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能看見地獄少女看見的東西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:57.80,0:05:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看見的東西她也應該能看見纔對
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:02.20,0:05:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相通 什麼意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:05.20,0:05:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原來如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:07.80,0:05:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在看的電視不知道她看到沒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:10.50,0:05:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:12.40,0:05:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夠了 回去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:14.20,0:05:14.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:16.00,0:05:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底對超能渡邊做了什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:18.30,0:05:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讓他見識了一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:20.70,0:05:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:23.50,0:05:24.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真敢吹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:25.40,0:05:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是 這個假冒靈能力者
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:31.00,0:05:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿部小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:32.60,0:05:34.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下週起的節目怎麼辦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:34.80,0:05:36.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那還用說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:36.60,0:05:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,改和那個男孩簽約
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:41.10,0:05:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼下週起請多關照
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:43.30,0:05:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彼此彼此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:45.00,0:05:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛苦了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:46.40,0:05:47.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一邊去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:47.80,0:05:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他肯定很怨恨吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:50.10,0:05:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然如此 讓他再怨恨些吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:54.20,0:05:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道地獄少女嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:56.40,0:05:57.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倒是聽過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:58.20,0:06:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她和我一樣散發着真實的氣息
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:02.20,0:06:05.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說不定不是這個世上的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:06.90,0:06:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過那樣的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:08.30,0:06:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:09.80,0:06:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基路 多 隆菲爾對地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:14.00,0:06:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿部小姐不想看嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:16.50,0:06:18.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想看 絕對要看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:18.80,0:06:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是到哪裏去聯繫她呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:22.50,0:06:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聯繫的話就拜託渡邊先生吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:25.20,0:06:27.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 是呢 好主意
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:28.40,0:06:30.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我馬上寫進計劃裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:32.60,0:06:33.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:34.10,0:06:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別以爲在網上有名氣 就自以爲了不起了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:41.10,0:06:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:48.20,0:06:50.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼說小姐也是不知不覺就向那個女孩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:51.70,0:06:52.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原來如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:53.60,0:06:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是說這邊可以向那邊傳達
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:57.40,0:06:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而那邊卻不能向這邊傳達呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:00.60,0:07:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 剛纔那個男的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:14.10,0:07:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,總之 這麼相信就夠了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:20.50,0:07:22.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 響了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:24.30,0:07:25.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身敗名裂了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:26.10,0:07:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那種對決不接受就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:29.40,0:07:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我幹嗎還在這裏擦靴子啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:34.90,0:07:36.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這下完了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:40.10,0:07:43.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉 真想再多賺點才死
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:48.00,0:07:49.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 渡邊先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:49.50,0:07:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天辛苦了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:50.80,0:07:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是阿部
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:53.20,0:07:54.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以後還要請你關照
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:55.10,0:07:58.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超能力的事儘管找我超能渡邊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:58.80,0:08:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,託您的福這次節目反響強烈啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:03.20,0:08:04.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定很鬱悶吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:05.30,0:08:08.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣 想不想向基路反擊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:09.40,0:08:13.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我幹我幹 包在我身上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:14.30,0:08:17.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那太好了 那明天21點攝影棚見
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:17.80,0:08:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包在我身上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:22.30,0:08:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,機會 等着瞧吧 基路
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:26.20,0:08:31.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這次我要把你煮了 看我怎麼煮你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:34.30,0:08:36.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,佈景這樣做就可以了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:37.50,0:08:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,節目安排得怎麼樣了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:39.60,0:08:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,時間太緊了 現場直播是不可能了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:42.90,0:08:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過第二天的特別節目中播出的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:45.60,0:08:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:47.40,0:08:48.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,21點過來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:49.10,0:08:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他本人爲了報復昨天的事幹勁十足呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:54.40,0:08:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當知道那是騙他的時候怨恨就會更深了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:59.10,0:09:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使這麼做也不知能不能聯繫上地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:04.10,0:09:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:05.20,0:09:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已經吩咐工作人員幹得徹底些
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:08.40,0:09:09.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那太感謝了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:10.10,0:09:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說起來 和地獄少女取得聯繫後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:13.10,0:09:14.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多長時間纔來呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:14.90,0:09:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:15.90,0:09:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是坐電車來呢 還是汽車呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:22.90,0:09:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚上好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:24.20,0:09:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您是哪位
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:27.80,0:09:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什麼事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:29.20,0:09:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些事情想問您
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:31.70,0:09:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,採訪的話能不能通過局裏的宣傳部呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:35.60,0:09:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能去地獄是真的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:39.10,0:09:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:40.60,0:09:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什麼時候的事呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:42.80,0:09:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小時侯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:44.00,0:09:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我說 採訪請通過宣傳部預約
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:47.00,0:09:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 您知道地獄少女嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:54.50,0:09:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在說什麼呢 我們什麼都不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:57.50,0:09:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有話想你替我轉告地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:00.00,0:10:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都說了 不知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:02.40,0:10:03.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:04.90,0:10:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手吧 誰也不會得到幸福
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:08.50,0:10:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,報仇是沒有意義的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:14.60,0:10:16.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,報仇是沒有意義的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:16.70,0:10:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:19.40,0:10:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在說什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:22.10,0:10:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是僞善嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:23.90,0:10:26.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 您說的沒錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:26.70,0:10:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過即使腦子裏明白
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:29.70,0:10:33.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心靈深處卻無論如何也想粉碎對手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:35.60,0:10:38.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人就是這樣的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:41.40,0:10:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也許是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:43.30,0:10:43.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:45.70,0:10:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼您怎麼樣呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:49.10,0:10:50.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:09.50,0:11:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做了什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:11.80,0:11:13.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剛纔是您的太太吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:14.20,0:11:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,話我會轉告的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:17.50,0:11:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過我想是不會得到回應了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:22.80,0:11:24.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是真傢伙嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:35.00,0:11:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已經12點了 要我等到什麼時候呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:38.50,0:11:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 大概還要好些時間吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:41.60,0:11:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基路先生的工作堆了很多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:44.40,0:11:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼只顧着他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:46.30,0:11:48.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒我這場反擊大戲無法開演吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:49.10,0:11:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和預想的一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:49.40,0:11:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:54.70,0:11:56.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基路先生說 想報仇的只是你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:57.00,0:11:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他希望更強的人當對手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:00.20,0:12:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:01.30,0:12:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:03.60,0:12:04.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼差不多了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:03.60,0:12:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以說 是基路先生的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:06.40,0:12:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那東西給他吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:08.20,0:12:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,渡邊先生肚子餓了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:11.10,0:12:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手 住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:11.10,0:12:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是基路先生請你的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:19.10,0:12:20.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想燙死我啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:23.00,0:12:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,該死 基路這傢伙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:26.00,0:12:28.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想耍我到什麼地步
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:28.70,0:12:30.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一會兒要狠狠教訓他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:33.20,0:12:34.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,電腦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:44.30,0:12:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄通信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:46.50,0:12:50.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是怪小姐呢還是怪那傢伙的女兒呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:50.40,0:12:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聲音太大了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:53.20,0:12:57.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也許不只是其中任一方的原因呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:58.10,0:12:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:00.40,0:13:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兩人之間也許存在着什麼接點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:08.10,0:13:09.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有委託 跟我來吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:25.30,0:13:25.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:26.60,0:13:27.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你在呼喚我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:28.20,0:13:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是閻魔愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:31.10,0:13:33.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小愛 你真可愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:34.50,0:13:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請收下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:38.80,0:13:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個要怎麼用
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:41.10,0:13:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你若真的要消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:44.60,0:13:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將這紅線解開即可
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:47.00,0:13:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開繩線
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:48.40,0:13:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就和我正式締結了契約
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:52.40,0:13:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:53.50,0:13:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怨恨的人將立刻墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:57.20,0:13:58.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼馬上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:58.30,0:13:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:59.10,0:14:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨若已消除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:00.70,0:14:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自身亦將付出代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:04.50,0:14:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害人終害己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:06.90,0:14:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,締結契約後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:08.60,0:14:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的靈魂亦將墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:12.40,0:14:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過那是你死之後的事了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:17.00,0:14:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:21.50,0:14:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕是當然的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:27.10,0:14:28.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:31.10,0:14:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:32.70,0:14:34.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我事先沒聽說啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:39.60,0:14:40.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,歡迎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:40.90,0:14:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高興見到你 閻魔愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:43.20,0:14:44.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 是你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:44.90,0:14:45.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:46.50,0:14:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是基路 多 隆菲爾
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:49.20,0:14:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是來自地獄的基路
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:51.90,0:14:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能讓真正的地獄少女大駕光臨實屬榮幸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:55.70,0:14:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基路 你竟敢利用我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:58.50,0:14:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛苦了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:02.10,0:15:03.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,燙 燙 燙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:06.00,0:15:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三流藝人喫蘿蔔真是太合適了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:09.40,0:15:12.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在 我來說明一下這次的計劃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:12.90,0:15:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如今在電視上最受關注的我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:16.60,0:15:19.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和網絡上最受關注的你之間的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:20.00,0:15:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,賭上生死的地獄對決
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:22.50,0:15:24.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即將播出
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:29.70,0:15:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被人設了陷阱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:32.40,0:15:35.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 怎麼可能贏得了小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:35.30,0:15:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太高興了這纔有意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:38.50,0:15:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 基路
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:40.40,0:15:42.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在跟誰說話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:42.30,0:15:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這怎麼做節目
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:44.60,0:15:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你說什麼啊 不是在這裏嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:52.00,0:15:52.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:56.20,0:15:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在幹什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:59.30,0:16:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是什麼荒謬的節目
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:02.40,0:16:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫我怎麼向上面解釋啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:09.80,0:16:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝了 那麼你們也
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:16.40,0:16:17.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:20.30,0:16:22.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒用的 你們解不開
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:29.50,0:16:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,終於只剩下我們了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:33.60,0:16:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對對 有個叫柴田的記者有話轉告你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:38.50,0:16:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說報仇不是好事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:42.70,0:16:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是充滿正義感呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:45.80,0:16:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼喜歡裝腔作勢的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:47.30,0:16:48.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就做點壞事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:48.60,0:16:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到那些被審判的人待的地獄裏去採訪不就行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:53.00,0:16:54.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過對他來說是勉強了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:55.30,0:16:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲他不像我這樣能從地獄回來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:00.60,0:17:03.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對 我是與生俱來的超能力者
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:04.90,0:17:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,發現此事的父母因爲害怕把我殺了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:08.90,0:17:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我從地獄回來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:11.80,0:17:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,並且
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:14.80,0:17:18.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回來之後首先把我的親生父母送下了地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:20.30,0:17:22.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什 什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:23.00,0:17:25.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是年幼時隨意使用能力
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:26.00,0:17:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,令周圍一片混亂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:27.90,0:17:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父母沒辦法才這麼做的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:30.30,0:17:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等長大一些後也許可以理解父母的所爲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:37.10,0:17:38.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我還是動手了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:39.10,0:17:42.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全沒有證據的完美殺人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:43.10,0:17:44.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把一家人都虐殺了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:50.70,0:17:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我並不打算將仇恨正當化
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:53.50,0:17:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但因爲這能力我喫盡了苦頭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:58.80,0:18:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也應該理解我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:02.60,0:18:03.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:03.90,0:18:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把別人送下地獄是因爲無法控制自己的仇恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:10.00,0:18:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能明白的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:15.10,0:18:17.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若是你的話應該明白吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:18.10,0:18:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:22.50,0:18:23.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說點什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:25.30,0:18:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:26.40,0:18:27.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,危險啊 小愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:30.10,0:18:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:31.10,0:18:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想辦法啊 輪入道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:34.40,0:18:37.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要解開繩子我就有辦法了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:37.60,0:18:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你似乎爲了別人再把壞人送往地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:40.50,0:18:41.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只是僞善
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:42.20,0:18:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你擁有那麼強大的力量
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:44.10,0:18:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼不爲了自己使用
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:50.00,0:18:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,衣服變的破破爛爛呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:52.60,0:18:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,實在不忍心就這樣送你下地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:56.10,0:18:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我讓你換上新的衣服吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:03.50,0:19:04.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺合身啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:06.50,0:19:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,實在是挺合身啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:11.90,0:19:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼該說永別了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:13.60,0:19:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再見
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:16.70,0:19:18.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:25.80,0:19:27.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們好好祭奠她吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:37.60,0:19:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:43.20,0:19:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:44.80,0:19:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:45.90,0:19:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:47.30,0:19:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼讓那傢伙爲所欲爲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:49.90,0:19:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在想事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:53.50,0:19:55.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這 不可能
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:56.20,0:19:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐 好好回敬他一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:59.40,0:20:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繩子還沒解開
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:01.30,0:20:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是這樣 而且小姐的心情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:04.90,0:20:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎樣都無所謂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:09.20,0:20:09.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:11.80,0:20:14.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你被這樣羞辱之後就打算回去了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:15.20,0:20:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼讓我來解開吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:18.70,0:20:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要解開
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:25.20,0:20:27.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開了你也要下地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:27.80,0:20:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是現在不解開繩子遲早被你幹掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:31.60,0:20:34.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我拜託她爲我復仇 你不可能放過我的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:35.10,0:20:37.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我放過你 真的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:37.20,0:20:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,騙人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:38.70,0:20:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄的恐怖是難以想象的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:41.30,0:20:42.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不可能承受
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:43.10,0:20:44.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別把我當傻子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:44.70,0:20:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看三流藝人的決心吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:50.30,0:20:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:07.70,0:21:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手 叫你們住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:11.80,0:21:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 媽媽 老師
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:16.50,0:21:19.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讓它們不要再復仇了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:19.50,0:21:21.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷失於黑暗的可悲之影
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:22.30,0:21:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傷害鄙視他人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:24.80,0:21:27.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沉溺於罪惡的孽魂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:27.60,0:21:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來死一次吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:30.60,0:21:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是又一次吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:47.70,0:21:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是地獄啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:51.20,0:21:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這次就讓你贏了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:54.10,0:21:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是無論送我下幾次地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:57.10,0:21:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都會活過來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:58.50,0:22:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和你再分勝負
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:03.10,0:22:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此怨此恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:05.80,0:22:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將流向地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:18.30,0:22:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,終於得救了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:34.50,0:22:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛 有委託
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:38.50,0:22:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:57.80,0:23:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,君之怨恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:16.10,0:23:21.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}い{\K30}つ{\K30}だっ{\K200}て　{\K30}行{\K30}き{\K30}止{\K30}まり{\K200}で
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:22.60,0:23:29.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}決{\K20}し{\K100}て　{\K40}逃{\K45}げ{\K40}ら{\K40}れ{\K70}な{\K200}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:29.50,0:23:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}空{\K140}の{\K40}鳥{\K120}へ　{\K40}哀{\K40}し{\K80}み{\K80}の{\K200}せ　{\K100}飛{\K40}ば{\K80}す{\K200}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:46.60,0:23:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K50}ここ{\K140}は{\K20}仮{\K70}縫{\K70}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:50.40,0:24:00.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K210}私{\K180}を{\K60\K100}縛{\K60}る{\K30\K140}永{\K200}遠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:01.40,0:24:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K80}行{\K20}き{\K100}も{\K30\K100}帰{\K80}り{\K200}も
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:08.30,0:24:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}過{\K30}ぎ{\K40}て{\K40\K240}ゆ{\K220}く{\K220}は{\K100}夢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:30.96,0:24:32.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本故事純屬虛構\N登場人物名 團體名等全部與現實無關
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:34.10,0:24:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名字是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:35.90,0:24:36.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村井優子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:37.60,0:24:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你恨他嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:40.10,0:24:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸相信着那個人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:43.30,0:24:45.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的把他當成心靈的一個支柱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:46.30,0:24:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可他卻一開始就
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:49.30,0:24:50.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,願望是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:51.10,0:24:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將那個人流放到地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:53.80,0:24:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:58.50,0:25:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\c&H0000FF&}下集
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:58.50,0:25:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}和藹的鄰居
